<title>JAPAN: Japan 3-mth T-bill auction lowest price 99.93.</title>
<headline>Japan 3-mth T-bill auction lowest price 99.93.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The auction of 1.5 trillion yen of three-month Treasury bills, or &quot;tankoku&quot;, produced the following results, the Ministry of Finance said on Monday:</p>
<p> Lowest price	99.93  Stop rate     0.284 pct</p>
<p> Average price     99.933 Average yield 0.269 pct</p>
<p> Total bids	   6.14971 trillion yen</p>
<p> Accepted Bids	1.49975 trillion yen</p>
<p> Bids accepted at lowest price 19.1444 pct</p>
<p> Issue date	 Feb 20, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity    May 20, 1997</p>
